white; color: #444444; font-family: \u0026quot;Arial\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;sans-serif\u0026quot;; font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 115%;\"\u003Eberikut hasil test\nkecepatannya :\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan style=\"background: white; color: #444444; font-family: \u0026quot;Arial\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;sans-serif\u0026quot;; font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 115%;\"\u003E\u003Cbr \/\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/div\u003E\n\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\"https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEiqjXZsRnc7pofk83JfhTeoxZ42dP5UMXkCAHvndzqLY3JrsmDPR9ubWz-49NIemgMODS4kLDYk-Ldm_0eeWjn9x7yYT_JADPgdcqqoR8VR1EwOxN5TVeMVzmWIf901FaBaZnP3fMfwNcIj\/s1600\/hasil+speedtest.png\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"\u003E\u003Cimg border=\"0\" src=\"https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEiqjXZsRnc7pofk83JfhTeoxZ42dP5UMXkCAHvndzqLY3JrsmDPR9ubWz-49NIemgMODS4kLDYk-Ldm_0eeWjn9x7yYT_JADPgdcqqoR8VR1EwOxN5TVeMVzmWIf901FaBaZnP3fMfwNcIj\/s1600\/hasil+speedtest.png\" \/\u003E\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003E\n\u003Cspan style=\"color: #444444; font-family: \u0026quot;Arial\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;sans-serif\u0026quot;; font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-no-proof: yes;\"\u003E\u003C!--[if gte vml 1]\u003E\u003Cv:shape\n id=\"Picture_x0020_7\" o:spid=\"_x0000_i1025\" type=\"#_x0000_t75\" alt=\"Description: D:\\Hobi\\hasil speedtest.png\"\n style='width:225pt;height:101.25pt;visibility:visible;mso-wrap-style:square'\u003E\n \u003Cv:imagedata src=\"file:\/\/\/C:\\Users\\WINDOW~1.1\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\msohtmlclip1\\01\\clip_image013.png\"\n  o:title=\"hasil speedtest\"\/\u003E\n\u003C\/v:shape\u003E\u003C![endif]--\u003E\u003C!--[if !vml]--\u003E\u003C!--[endif]--\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color: #444444; font-family: \u0026quot;Arial\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;sans-serif\u0026quot;; font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 115%;\"\u003E\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n\u003Cspan style=\"background: white;\"\u003Ekelebihan :\u003C\/span\u003E\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n\u003Cspan style=\"background: white;\"\u003E+ ukuran yang tipis (7 mm) dan ringan tapi kokoh\nserta dengan desain yang terkesan mewah.\u003C\/span\u003E\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n\u003Cspan style=\"background: white;\"\u003E+ Bisa berbagi untuk 10 pengguna\u003C\/span\u003E\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n\u003Cspan style=\"background: white;\"\u003E+ kecepatan internet\u0026nbsp; yang sanggat cepat (untuk area yang\ntercover).\u003C\/span\u003E\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n\u003Cspan style=\"background: white;\"\u003E+ harga paket internet yang relatif murah ex.\n99rb dpt 8 GB sebulan full tanpa syarat.\u003C\/span\u003E\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n\u003Cspan style=\"background: white;\"\u003Ekekurangan :\u003C\/span\u003E\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n\u003Cspan style=\"background: white;\"\u003E- Harga Modem yang relatif mahal (749rb)\u003C\/span\u003E\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n\u003Cspan style=\"background: white;\"\u003E- Jangkauan internet Bolt yang baru beberapa\nkota saja (sehingga kalau akan pergi keluar kota harus dilihat dulu di kota\ntujuan tercover atau tidak jaringan Boltnya).\u003C\/span\u003E\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n\u003Cspan style=\"background: white;\"\u003EKesimpulan :\u003C\/span\u003E\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n\u003Cspan style=\"background: white;\"\u003Edengan kelebihan dan kekurangan yg ada saya rasa\nperlu dipertimbangkan membeli modem ini. Terutama bagi yang ingin membeli modem\nyang tipis dan ringan agar mudah dibawa kemana2 (di sekitaran area yg\ntercover\u0026nbsp; tentunya hee) dengan kecepatan\ninternet yang mumpuni serta harga paket internet yang relatif murah.\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\/o:p\u003E\u003C\/div\u003E\n"},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https:\/\/nnfiles.blogspot.com\/feeds\/2856466500116327978\/comments\/default","title":"Posting Komentar"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"https:\/\/nnfiles.blogspot.com\/2015\/11\/review-kelebihan-dan-kekurangan-modem.html#comment-form","title":"5 Komentar"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https:\/\/www.blogger.com\/feeds\/875442420664186361\/posts\/default\/2856466500116327978"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https:\/\/www.blogger.com\/feeds\/875442420664186361\/posts\/default\/2856466500116327978"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"https:\/\/nnfiles.blogspot.com\/2015\/11\/review-kelebihan-dan-kekurangan-modem.html","title":"Review (kelebihan dan kekurangan)  Modem 4G LTE Bolt Vela"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"nn soekmana"},"uri":{"$t":"http:\/\/www.blogger.com\/profile\/12112325508259245496"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail","width":"16","height":"16","src":"https:\/\/img1.blogblog.com\/img\/b16-rounded.gif"}}],"media$thumbnail":{"xmlns$media":"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/","url":"https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEjkEEHyj-N9sxyF15MDDau8W-QWivDtAcLBfWQ_NLTmiK4lTJ4Xzhfk3btQEq1EvmN7E3nw-ww129W48I-80QZuKijBqw4pqjljIWdYXoppsY4B7lA-ArK_StgZFMBQFmU_zBI0lUhAnbDz\/s72-c\/vela+6.jpg","height":"72","width":"72"},"thr$total":{"$t":"5"}},{"id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-875442420664186361.post-6061425818375779575"},"published":{"$t":"2014-05-30T09:28:00.000-07:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2014-05-30T10:10:29.732-07:00"},"title":{"type":"text","$t":"Review (kelebihan dan kekurangan) tablet Lenovo S5000"},"content":{"type":"html","$t":"halo kali ini saya mau mencoba mereview tablet keluaran lenovo yaitu lenovo S5000.\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\"https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEiEEeXd95nuQdx7nvlnpWYmil9FEIR1TZVF3JuI7Ff6ucLYx4Ea-syJSJg43fiNIBKVhal5CFyeW7JvK_rrQbM-uTn3GITNwcUQrGGdA0cFRdac8_XCwQRENmH3OL6FljR8OP3Kj_FEZqdO\/s1600\/20140530_231841.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"\u003E\u003Cimg border=\"0\" src=\"https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEiEEeXd95nuQdx7nvlnpWYmil9FEIR1TZVF3JuI7Ff6ucLYx4Ea-syJSJg43fiNIBKVhal5CFyeW7JvK_rrQbM-uTn3GITNwcUQrGGdA0cFRdac8_XCwQRENmH3OL6FljR8OP3Kj_FEZqdO\/s1600\/20140530_231841.jpg\" height=\"320\" width=\"180\" \/\u003E\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003E\n\u003Cbr \/\u003E\u003C\/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\"https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEh9lDE5mu-GdOERgunYgBq2FFZ0eQau2slw8c_mpVtusvL4mUAefseXJCuymvPLr9MmJ4F1Z9Ik2Fcal-sw8x9Wtexy4DMP8hnm4u2d6aTfsI9mC7PFQTJwX2K3mr5uzNT1rWAb94CZRJ5r\/s1600\/20140530_231829.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"\u003E\u003Cimg border=\"0\" src=\"https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEh9lDE5mu-GdOERgunYgBq2FFZ0eQau2slw8c_mpVtusvL4mUAefseXJCuymvPLr9MmJ4F1Z9Ik2Fcal-sw8x9Wtexy4DMP8hnm4u2d6aTfsI9mC7PFQTJwX2K3mr5uzNT1rWAb94CZRJ5r\/s1600\/20140530_231829.jpg\" height=\"320\" width=\"180\" \/\u003E\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003E\n\u003Cbr \/\u003E\u003C\/div\u003E\n\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n\u003Cbr \/\u003E\nberikut spesifikasinya :\u003Cbr \/\u003E\nCPU : Quad-core 1.2 GHz Cortex-A7\u003Cbr \/\u003E\nRam : 1 GB\u003Cbr \/\u003E\nLayar : IPS 1280 x 800 pixels, 7.0 inches (~216 ppi pixel density)\u003Cbr \/\u003E\nKamera : Belakang 5 MP (tanpa flash), depan 1,6 MP\u003Cbr \/\u003E\nMemory : 16 GB internal (tanpa tambahan micro SD)\u003Cbr \/\u003E\nBaterai : 3450 mAh\u003Cbr \/\u003E\nSIM : micro SIM\u003Cbr \/\u003E\nOS : Android 4.2 (Jelly Bean)\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n\u003Cbr \/\u003E\nkelebihan :\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n+ ukuran yang tipis dan ringan dengan desain yang terkesan mewah.\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n+ spesifikasi yg cukup handal untuk beraktifitas seperti browsing, chatting, game atau office (ada aplikasi bawaan king office yg sangat berguna).\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n+ layar yang tajam dibanding dengan tablet sekelas merk lain yg harganya lebih mahal.\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n+ sudah mendukung fitur USB on the go (ini sangat bermanfaat, apalagi dengan tidak adanya fasilitas memory tambahan dari micro SD walau sebenarnya memory internalnya pun sudah cukup besar yaitu 16 GB).\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n+ harga yg relatif murah di bawah 3 jutaan dengan spesifikasi dan banyak kelebihan yg ditawarkan (bahkan kalau anda beruntung bisa membeli di toko-toko yang sedang ada promo cashback yg lumayan besar dan gratis aksesoris original).\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n\u003Cbr \/\u003E\nkekurangan :\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n- tidak ada slot micro SD.\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n- tidak ada fungsi telepon.\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n- kapasitas baterai yang kurang besar untuk ukuran tablet.\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n- tidak ada headset dan kabel OTG dalam paket penjualan.\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n- kamera belakang belum ada lampu flashnya\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n\u003Cbr \/\u003E\nKesimpulan :\u003Cbr \/\u003E\ndengan kelebihan dan kekurangan yg ada saya rasa tablet ini masih menguntung untuk anda miliki apalagi apabila anda senang browsing, chatting, game atau menggunakan office tanpa harus direpotkan dengan ukuran tablet yg besar dan berat ditambah desain yg bagus. dan yang terpenting harganya yg masih di bawah 3 jutaan dengan spesifikasi yg lebih baik dibanding merk terkenal lain yg harganya lebih mahal."},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https:\/\/nnfiles.blogspot.com\/feeds\/6061425818375779575\/comments\/default","title":"Posting Komentar"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"https:\/\/nnfiles.blogspot.com\/2014\/05\/review-kelebihan-dan-kekurangan-tablet.html#comment-form","title":"0 Komentar"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https:\/\/www.blogger.com\/feeds\/875442420664186361\/posts\/default\/6061425818375779575"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https:\/\/www.blogger.com\/feeds\/875442420664186361\/posts\/default\/6061425818375779575"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"https:\/\/nnfiles.blogspot.com\/2014\/05\/review-kelebihan-dan-kekurangan-tablet.html","title":"Review (kelebihan dan kekurangan) tablet Lenovo S5000"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"nn soekmana"},"uri":{"$t":"http:\/\/www.blogger.com\/profile\/12112325508259245496"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail","width":"16","height":"16","src":"https:\/\/img1.blogblog.com\/img\/b16-rounded.gif"}}],"media$thumbnail":{"xmlns$media":"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/","url":"https:\/\/blogger.googleusercontent.com\/img\/b\/R29vZ2xl\/AVvXsEiEEeXd95nuQdx7nvlnpWYmil9FEIR1TZVF3JuI7Ff6ucLYx4Ea-syJSJg43fiNIBKVhal5CFyeW7JvK_rrQbM-uTn3GITNwcUQrGGdA0cFRdac8_XCwQRENmH3OL6FljR8OP3Kj_FEZqdO\/s72-c\/20140530_231841.jpg","height":"72","width":"72"},"thr$total":{"$t":"0"}}]}}